Optional NEON blitter (32bpp-neon).

A port of the SSE blitter to ARM NEON, bit-identical to 32bpp-sse4 (tested
with tools/blitter-test). Compiles to nothing without __ARM_NEON; chosen
with -b 32bpp-neon.

For OpenTTD 14.1. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-openttd.

